the field picker falls back to the primitive's page-scale padding AND its
page-scale chevron gutter while the direction control beside it and the view
toggle next to it stay at `sm` — the oversized cluster that set the display
row's height and threw the section out.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

